{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design. Build. Launch. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the cockpit of creativity in AeroSpace Engineering | Sandbox \u2013 the ultimate physics-based simulation where your imagination meets the laws of aerodynamics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 Build anything \u2013 from space shuttles to experimental aircraft</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Test in realistic environments \u2013 gravity, atmosphere, and thrust all matter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Epic fails, glorious successes \u2013 learn, adapt, redesign</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 Automate systems with advanced logic tools and scripting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea Experiment with propulsion, aerodynamics, and stability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a future aerospace engineer or a sandbox simulation fanatic, AeroSpace Engineering | Sandbox gives you the tools to explore the skies and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Think like an engineer. Play like a creator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Your journey to the stars begins\u00a0in\u00a0the\u00a0sandbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986140?t=1762952188","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986140?t=1762952188","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986140/f12f3e755a4d832b961620bc8251c84d1da7edb3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762952188","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986140/f12f3e755a4d832b961620bc8251c84d1da7edb3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762952188","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detai